<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sw"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><title>Namba yako ya uthibitisho</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f5f7;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;">Namba yako ya uthibitisho ni {{.code}}. Itakwisha muda baada ya dakika {{.expires_in_minutes}}.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f4f5f7;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:520px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e3e6ea;border-radius:12px;">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 4px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111;">Namba yako ya uthibitisho</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Habari{{if .name}} {{.name}}{{end}},</p>
<p style="margin:0;">Tumia namba hii kuthibitisha utambulisho wako{{if .app_name}} kwenye {{.app_name}}{{end}}:</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:20px 32px;">
<div style="display:inline-block;padding:16px 28px;background:#f0f3f7;border:1px solid #dfe4ea;border-radius:10px;font-family:'SFMono-Regular',Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:34px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;color:#111111;-webkit-user-select:all;user-select:all;">{{.code}}</div>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:4px 32px 32px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;">
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Namba hii itakwisha muda baada ya <strong>dakika {{.expires_in_minutes}}</strong>. Ikiwa hukuiomba, puuza barua pepe hii; akaunti yako iko salama.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #eef0f3;color:#6b7280;font-size:12px;">Usimpe mtu yeyote namba hii. {{if .app_name}}{{.app_name}} haitakuomba{{else}}Hatutakuomba{{end}} namba hii kamwe.</p>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr></table>
</body></html>
